-275706" :question/problem "Find the **exact** value of the expression below.\n\n${\\cos }^{4}⁡({15}^{∘})-2{\\cos }^{2}⁡({15}^{∘}){\\sin }^{2}⁡({15}^{∘})+{\\sin }^{4}⁡({15}^{∘})=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that our expression is a perfect square that can be rewritten as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\cos }^{4}⁡({15}^{∘})-2{\\cos }^{2}⁡({15}^{∘}){\\sin }^{2}⁡({15}^{∘})+{\\sin }^{4}⁡({15}^{∘}) & ={({\\cos }^{2}⁡({15}^{∘})-{\\sin }^{2}⁡({15}^{∘}))}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n{\\cos }^{2}⁡x-{\\sin }^{2}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={15}^{∘}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\cos }^{2}⁡({15}^{∘})-{\\sin }^{2}⁡({15}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\cdot {15}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡({30}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{({\\cos }^{2}⁡({15}^{∘})-{\\sin }^{2}⁡({15}^{∘}))}^{2} & ={\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)}^{2}=\\frac{3}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186304985 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a81a47c7-179d-5483-a227-55f039ceab1f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303492}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a81a47c7-179d-5483-a227-55f039ceab1f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303492} :answer-field/id #uuid "b703b978-722c-5e0b-95fc-55b9de7046c9" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186304571}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "7557cacf-886f-55fb-9076-1837e9a0913c" :question/math-academy-id "q-332138" :question/problem "Find the **exact** value of the expression below.\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle {cos}^{2}\\,\\left(\\frac{7\\pi }{8}\\right)-{sin}^{2}\\,\\left(\\frac{7\\pi }{8}\\right)=\n$$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n{\\cos }^{2}⁡x-{\\sin }^{2}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=\\frac{7\\pi }{8}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{2}\\,\\left(\\frac{7\\pi }{8}\\right)-{sin}^{2}\\,\\left(\\frac{7\\pi }{8}\\right) & =\\cos \\,\\left(2\\cdot \\frac{7\\pi }{8}\\right) \\\\  & =\\cos \\,\\left(\\frac{7\\pi }{4}\\right) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186304986 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1704f202-ad10-5a8f-b37a-2571e0cb54a8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186302606}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1704f202-ad10-5a8f-b37a-2571e0cb54a8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186302606} :answer-field/id #uuid "b9f219ae-f2f8-5acf-af63-4e88382630fe" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186304582}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "24bac5e7-d993-51f0-aa0a-781406c4bd83" :question/math-academy-id "q-332139" :question/problem "Find the **exact** value of the expression below.\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle {cos}^{2}\\,\\left(\\frac{5\\pi }{12}\\right)-{sin}^{2}\\,\\left(\\frac{5\\pi }{12}\\right)=\n$$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n{\\cos }^{2}⁡x-{\\sin }^{2}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=\\frac{5\\pi }{12}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{2}\\,\\left(\\frac{5\\pi }{12}\\right)-{sin}^{2}\\,\\left(\\frac{5\\pi }{12}\\right) & =\\cos \\,\\left(2\\cdot \\frac{5\\pi }{12}\\right) \\\\  & =\\cos \\,\\left(\\frac{5\\pi }{6}\\right) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186