d55" :question/problem "Without using a calculator, find the **exact** value.\n\n$$\n\\cos^2\\left(\\frac{7\\pi}{8}\\right)-\\sin^2\\left(\\frac{7\\pi}{8}\\right)=\n$$\n{{field-1}}" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "Use the cosine double-angle identity:\n\n$$\n\\cos^2\\left(x\\right)-\\sin^2\\left(x\\right)=\\cos(2x)\n$$\n\nSubstitute the angle and evaluate the standard-angle cosine:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\cos^2\\left(\\frac{7\\pi}{8}\\right)-\\sin^2\\left(\\frac{7\\pi}{8}\\right) \\\\\n&= \\cos\\left(2\\cdot \\frac{7\\pi}{8}\\right) \\\\\n&= \\cos\\left(\\frac{7\\pi}{4}\\right) \\\\\n&= \\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right) \\\\\n&= \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186699259 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3cf7b389-8380-509c-92a6-babc7b58128a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186699245} {:answer/id #uuid "51ce2600-76e4-5bd2-a20e-4dac013f2e0d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186699248} {:answer/id #uuid "85b1be04-215f-54f3-8e1e-8e35317f9308" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186699257} {:answer/id #uuid "adbc056f-43da-5992-a235-cd443f48a8d8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186699261} {:answer/id #uuid "d3ab8163-6378-5e95-a0f3-5bcd1c93f0a3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186699266}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "adbc056f-43da-5992-a235-cd443f48a8d8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186699261} :answer-field/id #uuid "40231008-d257-54fd-b58d-79c46ed95aaf" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186699247}] :